Review comment:

- [P2] Finalize stmap30 campaign state — /Users/cunxiy/Documents/research/autoresearch-eda/abc-harness/.autoeda/runtime/campaign_state.json:9-11
  When these stmap30 source/results changes are treated as the completed iteration, leaving the state as `agent-running` with `active_iteration: 30` and `active_version: "stmap30"` makes the campaign tooling think the iteration is still in flight rather than advancing past the completed stmap0–stmap29 count. This can block/relaunch stmap30 or omit it from reporting; clear the active fields and update the completed/last-completed counters after validation.
